{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Knightfall: Rivals! </h2>After many years of fighting in the Crusades, the Knights Templar have returned to their home in Paris, only to find themselves thrust into a new kind of war, a power struggle that threatens to destroy their entire order.  Take on real players to help determine the course of history in this unique card-collecting game that offers serious PVP strategy and addictive gameplay.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending Old and New</h2>Rediscover nostalgic gameplay that has been developed to create a unique and endless strategic experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect and Conquer</h2>Expand your card collection and discover unique cards with special characters and powerful abilities.  Upgrade your cards to make them even more powerful, allowing for countless deck combinations and more complex strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fair and Fun</h2>Knightfall: Rivals is a true free-to-play title, offering generous rewards and multiple free opportunities to expand your card collection.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"e3620b90be68d745b963adf42eae2f681d2aee35.jpg","localized_name":"INITIATE TO KNIGHT","name":"INITIATE TO KNIGHT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/587460/e3620b90be68d745b963adf42eae2f681d2aee35.jpg"},{"icon":"ee95c077d9b04faedceb6b6fbb19f6bffff0f7c4.jpg","localized_name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/587460/ee95c077d9b04faedceb6b6fbb19f6bffff0f7c4.jpg"},{"icon":"ee95c077d9b04faedceb6b6fbb19f6bffff0f7c4.jpg","localized_name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/587460/ee95c077d9b04faedceb6b6fbb19f6bffff0f7c4.jpg"},{"icon":"ee95c077d9b04faedceb6b6fbb19f6bffff0f7c4.jpg","localized_name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","name":"TO CASUAL VICTORY!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.